<<set $Goblin = GetPartDisplayName("Goblin")>>

You look at your desk, cluttered with takeout boxes, empty styrafoam cups, and crumbs.
You slowly sweep the accumulated garbage into a trash bag, paying attention to not sweep your keyboard off in the process.
<<UnlockBehavior BehaviorPanel "Watch Anime">>
<<add_bond Goblin 10>>

